OL,3,GNEWSAPlans to convert former school
OL,4,Ainto gym approved
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Victorian building in Bradford which
OL,7,Fused to be a boys' school is to be
OL,8,Fturned into a community gym after plans
OL,9,Fwere approved.
OL,11,FThe Grade II listed building, which
OL,12,Fused to be St Mary's Catholic Boys'
OL,13,FSchool on East Parade in Little
OL,14,FGermany, has been empty for more than
OL,15,F10 years.
OL,17,FPinnacle Performance Fitness Studio,
OL,18,Fwhich is currently based on Nelson
OL,19,FStreet in Bradford, submitted a
OL,20,Fplanning application to convert the
OL,21,Fschool into a gym and community centre.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,383,380,200,160,0,100
