OL,3,GNEWSAPlans to convert former school
OL,4,Ainto gym approved
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlanning officers said the building
OL,7,F"shows signs of deterioration" and that
OL,8,Fthe new use would help safeguard its
OL,9,Ffuture.
